{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47031","headline":"煌煌京洛行 · 齐己","name":"煌煌京洛行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣君垂衣裳，荡荡若朝旭。\n大观无遗物，四夷来率服。\n清晨回北极，紫气盖黄屋。\n双阙耸双鳌，九门如川渎。\n梯山航海至，昼夜车相续。\n我恐红尘深，变爲黄河曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}